{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_047_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7dc0e6f1e25249cb813d0353773324016b816f6f64d7243c6bd5660990b08638",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42918725b374eb9dce6b696a96dc7a3ecf13eed0df5a8e18309720400f7c3a09",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，稍微方便一下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b77dfa170ae5e2a572713b7171746567b1fffc37a1ad45ec0b2631a09371e29a",
      "text": "我带了白色情人节的回礼过来。\n来，请收下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_a:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4059c3c35b56767a6ef569ca914197c8c83f1405df4f5062f774df993cc73208",
      "text": "选了感觉你可能会喜欢的类型，\n我想大概会合你的心意吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f142b25c808ff973f20d690598c31192359e14553b08ca1637fd31cc81a8865",
      "text": "还有，情人节时收到的巧克力，\n效果真是超拔群的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d178f14365be92ec8505e03def044e05158103b4a90eeb74d4962b8e06e295bc",
      "text": "多亏了你和那盒巧克力，\n我完成了很棒的工作。谢啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49d960ef93327aa5aca5b57beaffe107ea4acf323b97017d162ac48a41f3dd05",
      "text": "啊，在呢！\n……●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf125d1b38c86293eb7688a13575074fc8a3ac8881c9a224c88b6ba69f9910b8",
      "text": "明明听说你在事务所的，\n居然在这种地方……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdb292e74b5e5ceb856d64b57f2e0c768cbd9e3ae4381c71c132bbef89c5bf37",
      "text": "不，正好合适吧。\n现在只有你一个人对吧？借我一点时间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7311da6950011ad4181757e427b314b937de77ade1b3b552fe805ae025e5b479",
      "text": "给，这个。是情人节的回礼。\n之前不是说了要交给你嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000047:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20652153ead15d015ba20b940090ff510f5e2acbc866fbfc32adeb62349c188a",
      "text": "非常感谢。好开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000048:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:847e1e0d35eb38ae2a6b815a37cab43a7f70e7a18ba38e760b1096f3100240d4",
      "text": "很期待里面的东西！可以现在拆开吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e769962224beb759e8483f231a31865ec745238a9a53e68a21d0d6afea404395",
      "text": "我挑了你绝对会喜欢的款式哦。\n拆开看了就知道了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e82726f87c77649901e8c14a654d6120a4c936d6f530843a176cc000f1905dc",
      "text": "现、现在不行。虽然想看到你吃惊的表情，\n但当着我的面确认……总觉得挺难为情的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:feb86b564a07f10e5936a9c7cbe387cb8230192553413d237e54e8572209b383",
      "text": "……那么，事情办完了，我就先走啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_047_22:5_02_047_22_b:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55b8879916f0fc438a2cce37b72d3ce58f4e63a34c7b0912f31b055a02688ac2",
      "text": "那份回礼，等我走掉之后再拆哦。\n我等着听感想呢。回头见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
